{
  "_comment": [
    "The component -> notice mapping package-notices.py packages and validates.",
    "Three things bind this mapping to reality, and all three are enforced:",
    "  pin_digest      - SHA-256 of the Package.resolved (identity, revision) set.",
    "  manifest_digest - SHA-256 of Package.swift. Not parsed: any edit makes the",
    "                    mapping stale until re-reviewed. A regex over product",
    "                    declarations missed a product carrying a condition:",
    "                    argument, and every narrower fix leaves the next",
    "                    declaration form open (review round 3).",
    "  sha256          - per notice, the exact bytes of its authority. Phrases in",
    "                    must_contain say WHY a file matters; the hash says it is",
    "                    that file. A notice without a sha256 is an error.",
    "`selection` below is the product set those digests were reviewed against \u2014",
    "a record for the next reviewer, not itself the enforcement."
  ],
